# Hybrid design (mandatory)

Read `design-system/HYBRID.md` before UI work.

## Route split

| Routes | System | Classes / folder |
|--------|--------|------------------|
| `/` (Home), Header, Footer | **Newsplus brand** | `brand-*`, `components/brand/`, `tokens.css` |
| `/news`, `/generate`, `/translate` | **Nothing tools** | `.theme-tools`, `nd-*`, `ToolPage` |

## Before coding

1. Identify surface: marketing vs tool.
2. Marketing: Taste Skill + Newsplus palette (navy/teal/coral). No monochrome takeover.
3. Tools: Nothing skill — monochrome, Space Mono labels, segmented bars, inline `[STATUS]` text.
4. Never apply Nothing styles to Header/Footer or Home hero.

## Stack

React 19 + Vite + Tailwind v4 · fonts: Geist + Noto Arabic (brand) · Space Grotesk/Mono (tools).
